  'regex-match': ['The regular expression caret opening bracket A to Z closing bracket brace two brace dollar accepts AB and rejects Ab and ABC in the stated no-flags tests', 'For the literal strings AB, Ab and ABC, with no flags, ^[A-Z]{2}$ matches only AB. A-Z selects uppercase ASCII letters and {2} requires two. Pattern behaviour also depends on flags, engine and input, including line endings.'],
