  'coordinate-projection': ['Geographic longitude and latitude being converted to projected easting and northing', 'A map projection converts geographic coordinates to coordinates on a plane. Reprojecting transforms coordinates; assigning a CRS label alone does not. A change of datum may require an additional transformation. No numerical conversion is specified here.'],
  'central-projection': ['An illustrative two-dimensional cross-section with rays from centre P through A and B to projected points A prime and B prime', 'In this selected cross-section, the projection rays meet at the centre P. A and A′ lie on one ray; B and B′ on another. This is central projection; parallel projection uses parallel rays.'],
